        <mxCell id="4" value="&lt;h1&gt;STUDENT REQUIREMENTS [FULL]&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;1. Can give and check attendance through the app. They will be able to check attendance of each specific Subject. And Overall also.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;2. They can fetch their marks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;3. They can check books they have withdrawn from library and the due date.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;4. Able to pay all types of fees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;5. Able to fill up form.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;6.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
